@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<div class="col-lg-8">
    <h1 class="h2 mb-3">Privacy</h1>
    <p>
        Cinema 101 is a university lab project. It stores only the movie, actor and role data that
        admins enter, together with audit information: the ID of the admin who created or last changed
        each record, and when (UTC).
    </p>
    <p class="mb-0">
        The site uses cookies only to protect its forms against cross-site request forgery and to show
        a confirmation message after you add, edit or delete a record. All styles and scripts are served
        from this site; nothing is loaded from the internet.
    </p>
</div>
